  "collectionNotes": [
    "Official ESP-IDF guide identifies01_factory as factory program; official flashing guide points to this exact Firmware directory and0x0; original app descriptor identifies factory_01.",
    "Exact source URLs, fetch identity, hashes and source-specific deviations preserved. No firmware bodies mirrored.",
    "ES8311/ES7210 control register endpoints only; microphone capture, PCM playback, voice recognition, camera/display options and cloud services are not implemented.",
    "Three keys are TCA9555 inputs P11/P12/P13 (linear9/10/11). Seven RGB chain positions have not been mapped to native3D parts.",
    "SKU32184 includes native1000mAh battery. SKU32185/EN excludes it; battery/charging/RTC-backup electrical physics remain unmodeled.",
    "Source-bounded digital subset only. Original factory execution, browser/WebGL and physical hardware acceptance are separate; no complete compatibility claim."
  ]
